meta {
  name: Complete Sale (Example)
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/sales/complete
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "userId": "578d0dbb-ccd3-4dd7-9df9-0e7943f83615",
    "lines": [
      {
        "productId": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
        "quantity": 2,
        "unitPrice": 7.00
      },
      {
        "productId": "b2c3d4e5-f6a7-8901-bcde-f12345678901",
        "quantity": 1,
        "unitPrice": 15.00
      }
    ],
    "payments": [
      {
        "method": "Cash",
        "amount": 30.00
      }
    ]
  }
}

docs {
  # Complete Sale (Example with multiple items)

  Example sale with 2 different products:
  - 2x น้ำดื่ม @ 7 baht = 14 baht
  - 1x โค้ก @ 15 baht = 15 baht
  - Total: 29 baht
  - Paid: 30 baht cash (1 baht change)

  **Important:** Update the GUIDs with real values from:
  - `userId`: from login response
  - `productId`: from "Get All Products" response

  **Workflow:**
  1. Login as cashier
  2. Get products list
  3. Copy the real IDs
  4. Update this request
  5. Execute
}
